  "about_paragraphs": [
    "RG Constructions developers and builders are here to help you get the job done right. We have a wide range of construction services to choose from, so you can find the perfect one for your needs.",
    "Beyond Bricks is a part of the fastest-growing construction industry in Telangana.",
    "We are construction contractors and builders working as an extension of RG Constructions based in Hyderabad. We help you build apartments, independent villas, and commercial and turnkey projects. We specialise in construction monitoring and management services to ensure timely possession within clients' pre-fixed budgets.",
